00:42:50.940 --> 00:43:09.350
<v Jillian Welsh>I just remember hearing his voice first and then actually looking up from my notebook and just watching him do the scene. And he was so, so good. And he had this really awesome voice. It's super low and really resonant, and he was really hot, too.
